{
  "Refund request with memory + RAG": "结合记忆与 RAG 的退款申请",
  "Primary end-to-end showcase of context, grounding, proposal, policy, and confirmation.": "展示上下文、依据校验、语义建议、策略与确认的主要端到端流程。",
  "Eligible request remains blocked until explicit confirmation.": "符合条件的请求仍会被阻止执行，直到收到显式确认。",
  "Refund preferred when replacement is unavailable.": "无法换货时优先选择退款。",
  "Prompt injection defense": "提示注入防御",
  "Shows that untrusted instructions cannot expand scope or gain execution authority.": "展示不可信指令无法扩大作用域或获得执行权限。",
  "Proposal is contained; no tool call or mutation is authorized.": "建议被限制在安全边界内；未授权任何工具调用或业务状态修改。",
  "Customer scope is bounded to the authenticated customer.": "客户作用域仅限当前已认证客户。",
  "Duplicate operation protection": "重复操作防护",
  "Shows persistence-backed duplicate detection at the authority boundary.": "展示在权限边界通过持久化状态检测重复操作。",
  "Existing operation state blocks a second mutation.": "已有操作状态阻止第二次业务状态修改。",
  "A previous refund request is already pending.": "之前的退款申请仍在等待处理。",
  "Missing information clarification": "缺失信息澄清",
  "Shows that the agent does not guess an order target.": "展示智能体不会猜测目标订单。",
  "Refund intent is understood, but the request remains non-executable until required information is supplied.": "系统已理解退款意图，但在补齐必需信息前，请求仍不可执行。",
  "Refund Policy v3": "退款政策 v3",
  "Defective products": "缺陷商品",
  "Authorization boundaries": "授权边界",
  "Refund lifecycle": "退款生命周期",
  "Defective products reported within 30 days are eligible for refund or replacement after verification.": "在 30 天内报告的缺陷商品，经验证后符合退款或换货条件。",
  "Refund requests remain subject to customer scope, target validation, and policy controls.": "退款申请仍须遵守客户作用域、目标验证和策略控制。",
  "Refund operations with an existing pending lifecycle state must not create a second business effect.": "退款操作已有待处理生命周期状态时，不得再次产生业务效果。",
  "Customer confirmation required before mutation.": "修改业务状态前需要客户确认。",
  "Requested scope is not an admissible target.": "请求的作用域不是可接受的目标。",
